         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>Please call our office at: <a href=\"tel:832-717-3937\">832-717-3937</a> if you experience loss of vision, double vision, swelling, infection or any eye emergency, contact us immediately for guidance. We’ll help you with the best treatment to prevent complications and promote long-lasting clear eyesight.</p><p>Use your best judgment on urgency – find the nearest emergency room or review our <a href=\"/eye-care-services/eye-emergencies-pinkred-eyes/\">emergency page for tips.</a></p><p>Wondering how to pay for your eye care? Check Out Our <a href=\"/insurance/\">Insurance Plans</a>.</p>"
